0 brickkit overlay for "Wing 2 x 3 Right with Chamfer" (43722b, wedge plate 3 x 2)
0 // The LDCad shadow library has no file for this wedge plate and its underside is drawn with
0 // plain cylinders, so it gets no stud holes and never sits on anything. Holes under its stud
0 // column and under the full-width end, as LDCad gives the 4 x 2 wedge plates (41769a).
